WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.388 --> 00:00:01.505
- Hey guys, my name's Hal.

00:00:01.505 --> 00:00:02.338
- I'm Delisa.

00:00:02.338 --> 00:00:03.171
- I'm Vaughn.

00:00:03.171 --> 00:00:04.758
- And we just did something
pretty crazy the other night,

00:00:04.758 --> 00:00:05.779
and we want to tell you all about it,

00:00:05.779 --> 00:00:06.750
so story time!

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.187
- Can we get some wine?

00:00:08.187 --> 00:00:09.359
- Yeah, I think it's
time to pour some wine.

00:00:09.359 --> 00:00:10.192
- Let's get some wine.

00:00:10.192 --> 00:00:12.775
(upbeat music)

00:00:15.137 --> 00:00:17.037
- What do you think the
title of the story should be?

00:00:17.037 --> 00:00:20.287
- How about, "One Night in
Trump's Childhood Home"?

00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:21.973
- I like it, clear, concise.

00:00:21.973 --> 00:00:23.120
"One Night in Trump's Childhood Home."

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:23.953
Cheers!

00:00:23.953 --> 00:00:24.980
- Cheers.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:28.480
(upbeat orchestral music)

00:00:43.998 --> 00:00:44.831
- You're from Queens.

00:00:44.831 --> 00:00:46.104
- I am, I'm from Queens.

00:00:46.104 --> 00:00:49.623
- And I just saw your
childhood home is for sale.

00:00:49.623 --> 00:00:51.451
- Oh wow, I want to see that.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:52.284
- [Donald Trump] That's it!

00:00:52.284 --> 00:00:53.117
- [Jimmy Fallon] That's your house?

00:00:53.117 --> 00:00:54.408
- [Donald Trump] That's where I was born.

00:00:54.408 --> 00:00:55.847
- How in the world did
you find out about this?

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:57.120
- Okay, so the story goes:

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.285
On Buzzfeed.com, an article
popped up and it was all about

00:01:01.285 --> 00:01:04.192
how Trump's childhood
home is now an Airbnb.

00:01:04.192 --> 00:01:05.696
I saw the article, and I immediately said,

00:01:05.696 --> 00:01:09.002
"I absolutely want to
make a video about this."

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.814
- I think there might be
something wrong with me

00:01:10.814 --> 00:01:13.171
that made you think
that I would enjoy this.

00:01:13.171 --> 00:01:14.777
- Well I thought that we all could

00:01:14.777 --> 00:01:16.307
share this experience together

00:01:16.307 --> 00:01:17.539
and it would bring us closer.

00:01:17.539 --> 00:01:20.135
- I didn't have very many expectations.

00:01:20.135 --> 00:01:21.988
What do you think it's gonna smell like?

00:01:21.988 --> 00:01:23.127
- Old white man.

00:01:23.127 --> 00:01:26.153
- Yup. And a hint of Drakkar Noir.

00:01:26.153 --> 00:01:27.331
(Delisa laughs)

00:01:27.331 --> 00:01:29.438
But when I got there, I was like,

00:01:29.438 --> 00:01:31.841
"Damn, this is nice."

00:01:31.841 --> 00:01:34.421
You know this honestly kind of reminds me

00:01:34.421 --> 00:01:37.266
of Privet Drive from Harry Potter.

00:01:37.266 --> 00:01:38.349
- Okay, yeah!

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:42.181
(Vaughn laughs)
- Trump's childhood home.

00:01:42.181 --> 00:01:44.064
- [Vaughn] Oh, my god.

00:01:44.064 --> 00:01:46.142
I would say it was a very nice house,

00:01:46.142 --> 00:01:49.666
especially for the era
in which it was built.

00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:52.137
I would say that this
was a very nice house.

00:01:52.137 --> 00:01:53.912
- [Hal] It definitely felt very Madmen.

00:01:53.912 --> 00:01:57.101
All of the decor in the
house is Trump-themed,

00:01:57.101 --> 00:01:59.022
which was really kind of freaky to me.

00:01:59.022 --> 00:02:00.933
There's like cardboard cutouts of Trump,

00:02:00.933 --> 00:02:05.777
and photos of Trump, and quotes
by Trump all over the house.

00:02:05.777 --> 00:02:06.897
Welcome!

00:02:06.897 --> 00:02:11.731
- Everywhere I look, there's
something with his face on it.

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:12.866
Everywhere!

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:16.366
- Wow! This is wild.

00:02:17.322 --> 00:02:19.459
- My favorite room was the large room

00:02:19.459 --> 00:02:23.009
that had so much space for activities.

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:25.732
I was doing leaps, jetes.

00:02:25.732 --> 00:02:27.662
This is bigger than my apartment,

00:02:27.662 --> 00:02:29.829
and it's only one bedroom.

00:02:30.796 --> 00:02:31.629
Wow!

00:02:33.058 --> 00:02:35.862
- At the back of the house was the study.

00:02:35.862 --> 00:02:37.375
I could really see like,

00:02:37.375 --> 00:02:40.838
young Donald crapping in
his diaper back there.

00:02:40.838 --> 00:02:43.171
"Listen, this crap is huge."

00:02:44.489 --> 00:02:46.684
- "Listen, the crap in my diaper is huge."

00:02:46.684 --> 00:02:47.517
- Huge.

00:02:47.517 --> 00:02:48.433
- I sound like Jerry Seinfeld,
(Vaughn laughs)

00:02:48.433 --> 00:02:49.654
not Donald Trump.

00:02:49.654 --> 00:02:51.328
There's also an entire shelf,

00:02:51.328 --> 00:02:53.148
and all that's in the shelf is

00:02:53.148 --> 00:02:56.131
like a shrine to Donald Trump,

00:02:56.131 --> 00:02:57.428
and the Trump board game.

00:02:57.428 --> 00:02:58.924
- This is weird.

00:02:58.924 --> 00:03:01.114
It says, "This bedroom is likely

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:05.054
"the childhood bedroom
President Donald J. Trump,

00:03:05.054 --> 00:03:07.477
"who lived in this home from '46 to '50."

00:03:07.477 --> 00:03:09.685
I'm confused as to why it says

00:03:09.685 --> 00:03:12.103
this was likely the bedroom of child...

00:03:12.103 --> 00:03:14.764
Like, do they not know?

00:03:14.764 --> 00:03:17.981
- It's a pretty expensive
Airbnb, so yeah I agree.

00:03:17.981 --> 00:03:19.579
Like, if you're gonna stay
here, you'd wanna definitely

00:03:19.579 --> 00:03:20.805
for sure want to know.
- I would want to

00:03:20.805 --> 00:03:23.238
for sure know which room was the Donald's.

00:03:23.238 --> 00:03:26.021
- [Hal] I thought the weirdest
room was the master bedroom

00:03:26.021 --> 00:03:30.656
with that whack as hell sign
that was hanging above the bed.

00:03:30.656 --> 00:03:32.868
- I think I'm in the master bedroom.

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:34.313
Here it looks like there's
something that says,

00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:37.540
"In this bedroom,
President Donald J. Trump

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:41.617
"was likely conceived by his
parents, Fred and Mary Trump.

00:03:41.617 --> 00:03:45.402
"The world has never been the same."

00:03:45.402 --> 00:03:46.912
Can't argue with that one.

00:03:46.912 --> 00:03:49.317
- I just don't understand
why it needed to be said.

00:03:49.317 --> 00:03:51.980
I think we all could have
inferred, or gathered.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.659
The fact that there was a gold plaque,

00:03:53.659 --> 00:03:55.201
that was a little much.

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:57.075
- [Hal] This is the
room where it happened.

00:03:57.075 --> 00:03:58.953
And by it, I mean, Donald Trump's

00:03:58.953 --> 00:03:59.986
- [Both] Conception.

00:03:59.986 --> 00:04:02.477
- I never wanted to think
about that conception,

00:04:02.477 --> 00:04:04.223
but here I am in the damn room.

00:04:04.223 --> 00:04:06.949
- [Hal] There were, "The
Art of the Deal" copies

00:04:06.949 --> 00:04:09.936
in every single room of that house.

00:04:09.936 --> 00:04:13.061
- [Vaughn] Literally, this
is in absolutely every room.

00:04:13.061 --> 00:04:15.043
Like they were not kidding
when they said that.

00:04:15.043 --> 00:04:17.602
- [Hal] Every bathroom was
bright Pepto Bismol pink.

00:04:17.602 --> 00:04:19.456
- And then that one large ass tub.

00:04:19.456 --> 00:04:20.933
- [Hal] You did not like that tub.

00:04:20.933 --> 00:04:23.878
- Best believe I am not
getting my ass in that tub.

00:04:23.878 --> 00:04:25.162
- So when it was time to go to bed,

00:04:25.162 --> 00:04:27.951
how were we all feeling?
(quirky music)

00:04:27.951 --> 00:04:29.529
- Y'all, I feel weird.

00:04:29.529 --> 00:04:30.687
I might need to go check into

00:04:30.687 --> 00:04:32.686
like a La Quinta Inn or something.

00:04:32.686 --> 00:04:34.377
- This is getting creepy.

00:04:34.377 --> 00:04:36.288
Regardless of who lived there before,

00:04:36.288 --> 00:04:39.006
it was just an old home.

00:04:39.006 --> 00:04:40.432
And it was very quiet,

00:04:40.432 --> 00:04:43.819
and it was just creaky and eerie.

00:04:43.819 --> 00:04:45.255
I was uncomfortable.

00:04:45.255 --> 00:04:46.681
- So I'm making Hal
come downstairs with me

00:04:46.681 --> 00:04:49.683
to get the WiFi password because

00:04:49.683 --> 00:04:51.926
I'm too scared to do it by myself.

00:04:51.926 --> 00:04:53.235
- Okay guys, I'm going to bed.

00:04:53.235 --> 00:04:54.158
I'm gonna do it.

00:04:54.158 --> 00:04:55.238
I am gonna sleep in the room

00:04:55.238 --> 00:04:58.227
where Donald Trump was conceived.

00:04:58.227 --> 00:05:00.926
God, okay.

00:05:00.926 --> 00:05:01.759
Goodnight.

00:05:04.961 --> 00:05:07.589
- So, I just went to
the restroom by myself.

00:05:07.589 --> 00:05:09.273
I'm like low-key nervous to just like

00:05:09.273 --> 00:05:11.356
walk back to the bedroom.

00:05:12.377 --> 00:05:14.005
Yeah, it's 3 o'clock in the morning,

00:05:14.005 --> 00:05:15.964
and I'm absolutely terrified.

00:05:15.964 --> 00:05:19.679
Pro-tip: Always go to the
restroom before you go to bed.

00:05:19.679 --> 00:05:22.262
(quirky music)

00:05:26.661 --> 00:05:29.161
- Delisa, how are you feeling?

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:35.244
Hard to sleep, not gonna lie.

00:05:35.244 --> 00:05:37.907
- Bye Trump house.

00:05:37.907 --> 00:05:40.823
Bye Trump's parent's room.

00:05:40.823 --> 00:05:42.756
Bye Trump's room.

00:05:42.756 --> 00:05:45.690
- Okay, the car is coming in four minutes.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.273
Any final thoughts?

00:05:49.006 --> 00:05:51.729
- [Vaughn] Politics aside,
I think that being there

00:05:51.729 --> 00:05:56.512
in this home with this public
figure you know so well,

00:05:56.512 --> 00:05:59.528
and you knew that this was his beginning.

00:05:59.528 --> 00:06:02.550
That was his inception, and his conception

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:03.834
(all laugh)

00:06:03.834 --> 00:06:04.821
- [Delisa] All the -ceptions.

00:06:04.821 --> 00:06:08.164
- [Vaughn] All the -ceptions
happened in that damn house.

00:06:08.164 --> 00:06:10.433
- [Delisa] I'm glad I went
through that with y'all.

00:06:10.433 --> 00:06:11.444
I don't think it would have been as fun

00:06:11.444 --> 00:06:12.833
if it wasn't for y'all.

00:06:12.833 --> 00:06:14.691
- That is definitely an
experience I will never forget,

00:06:14.691 --> 00:06:18.297
and an experience I never
want to have again. (laughs)

00:06:18.297 --> 00:06:19.309
(Delisa laughs)

00:06:19.309 --> 00:06:20.847
- Amen to that.

00:06:20.847 --> 00:06:23.404
I am finishing this wine.
- Finish it.

00:06:23.404 --> 00:06:27.071
(upbeat orchestral music)

